# The human pass and solo mode (docs/guide/concepts-human-pass.md).
title: A person always signs off; alone, you record that you did it alone
direction: down
gate: Merge gate green, inspect says merge
pass: A second person approves: the human pass
solo: Only you: a recorded solo-mode bypass
ship: ship merges and writes the record
gate -> pass: team
gate -> solo: solo
pass -> ship
solo -> ship
